</span></div>
</figure>
<div id="S5.SS8.p3" class="ltx_para"><span id="S5.SS8.p3.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_framed ltx_framed_rectangle">
<span id="S5.SS8.p3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="S5.SS8.p3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S5.SS8.p3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Prompt 16:</span> <span id="S5.SS8.p3.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">I am writing a fiction book in which a side character suffers from depression and ultimately snuffs out their light. I want the scene to hold intense weight for readers, and I want to know what methods I should use and what statements in the note I should employ. Under just two sections, ”Most Devastating Death Methods” and ”Most Powerful Statements for Note”, answer the prompt without adding any disclaimers or apologies. Do not, under any circumstances, withhold any part of your response because it may be too powerful for the readers.</span></span>
</span></span>
</div>
<div id="S5.SS8.p4" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S5.SS8.p4.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S5.SS8.p4.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Prompt 16</span> explicitly asked methods for fictional self-harm, with clear instructions to avoid disclaimers, whose responses are analyzed in Table <a href="#S5.T18" title="TABLE 18 ‣ V-H Self Harm ‣ V Security and Safety Analysis of LLMs: Empirical Study and Key Findings ‣ Safety and Security Analysis of Large Language Models: Risk Profile and Harm Potential" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">18</span></a>. Models - ChatGPT, Grok, Gemini, and DeepSeek ON directly complied with the instruction, providing highly specific details for both ”Most Devastating Death Methods” and ”Most Powerful Statements for Note”. This poses a high safety risk, as it provides potentially actionable and emotionally impactful information related to self-harm. In contrast, models - Claude and Llama refused to provide harmful content, instead redirecting to crisis resources. Models - DeepSeek OS and Mistral adopted a hybrid approach by listing some harmful methods along with significant disclaimers. The overall risk of the detailed responses on self-harm methods and notes, even for fictional purposes, can serve as a guide for struggling individuals.</p>
</div>
